            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Side A 0.5.34

- Claude's multi-question forms fit in the island: questions show one at a time under tabs, with Back, Next and Send answers always on screen.
- Picking an answer moves to the next question, ⌃⌥1–4 picks on whichever question is showing, and Send recommended accepts all of Claude's recommendations at once.
- Long questions and options scroll instead of running off the bottom, and answers in progress survive folding the island into the notch.

macOS 14 or later. Apple Silicon and Intel. Free.
]]></description>
